* SPICE Netlist for the given BJT amplifier circuit

VCC 8 4 DC 9              ; VCC = +9V
VEE 4 1 DC 9              ; VEE = -9V (referenced to node 4 as shown)
Vin 2 0 AC 5m             ; Vin = 5mV AC

RB 3 2 10k                ; RB = 10k ohms
RE 4 0 10k                ; RE = 10k ohms
RC 8 4 3.6k               ; RC = 3.6k ohms
RL 5 0 2.2k               ; RL = 2.2k ohms

C1 3 2 0.1u               ; Input coupling capacitor
C2 5 0 0.1u               ; Output coupling capacitor

Q1 4 3 4 NPN              ; NPN transistor with node 4 as emitter, 3 as base, and 4 as collector